<title>USA: Manhattan Bagel names James O'Connor CFO.</title>
<headline>Manhattan Bagel names James O'Connor CFO.</headline>
<dateline>EATONTOWN, N.J. 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Manhattan Bagel Co Inc Monday said former RJR Nabisco Holdings Corp senior financial executive James O'Connor has joined the company as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>A spokesman for Manhattan Bagel was not available for comment.</p>
<p>Manhattan Bagel franchises, licenses and operates over 310 stores in 17 states, Washington D.C. and Canada.</p>
</text>
